  "claim_short": "Langharst Liu Tang Weighted Lp Minkowski Problem final Appendix conjecture (1/n)-concavity complement of symmetric convex body. Full explicit counterexample: standard Gaussian gamma_2, K=6 B_2^2, L=2 B_2^2, t=1/2. The Minkowski sum (1/2)(R^2 minus int K)+(1/2)L is exactly R^2 minus int(2B_2^2). Its Gaussian mass is exp(-2), while the conjectured right side is greater than (1-exp(-2))/4, which exceeds exp(-2)...",
